    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "urgent care doesnt really do heart stuff though right? i feel like if it was actually a heart attack i'd be dying or something. i'm mostly just feeling really worked up and my heart is racing a bit. do you think i could just take some extra melatonin or maybe an herbal tea to help me calm down so i can sleep this off? i really just need to relax and get through the night.",
